  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new ResourceArrayPropertyEditor with the given <a href=\"ResourcePatternResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>ResourcePatternResolver</code></a>\nand <a href=\"../../env/PropertyResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertyResolver</code></a> (typically an <a href=\"../../env/Environment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>).",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 `ResourceArrayPropertyEditor`，使用给定的 `<a href=\"ResourcePatternResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>ResourcePatternResolver</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"../../env/PropertyResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertyResolver</code></a>`（通常是 `<a href=\"../../env/Environment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>`）。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new ResourceArrayPropertyEditor with a default\n<a href=\"PathMatchingResourcePatternResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>PathMatchingResourcePatternResolver</code></a> and <a href=\"../../env/StandardEnvironment.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>StandardEnvironment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 ResourceArrayPropertyEditor，默认使用<a href=\"PathMatchingResourcePatternResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>PathMatchingResourcePatternResolver</code></a>和<a href=\"../../env/StandardEnvironment.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>StandardEnvironment</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>resourcePatternResolver</code> - the ResourcePatternResolver to use",
      "translation": "<code>resourcePatternResolver</code> - 要使用的 ResourcePatternResolver",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>propertyResolver</code> - the PropertyResolver to use",
      "translation": "<code>propertyResolver</code> - 要使用的 PropertyResolver",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "A path may contain <code>${...}</code> placeholders, to be\nresolved as <a href=\"../../env/Environment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> properties:\nfor example, <code>${user.dir}</code>. Unresolvable placeholders are ignored by default.",
      "translation": "路径可以包含 `<code>${...}</code>` 占位符，这些占位符将被解析为 <a href=\"../../env/Environment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 属性；例如：<code>${user.dir}</code>。默认情况下，无法解析的占位符会被忽略。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegates to a <a href=\"ResourcePatternResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>ResourcePatternResolver</code></a>,\nby default using a <a href=\"PathMatchingResourcePatternResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>PathMatchingResourcePatternResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "委托给一个<a href=\"ResourcePatternResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>ResourcePatternResolver</code></a>，默认使用一个<a href=\"PathMatchingResourcePatternResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>PathMatchingResourcePatternResolver</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Considers String elements as location patterns and takes Resource elements as-is.",
      "translation": "将 String 元素视为位置模式，并按原样处理 Resource 元素。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the given path, replacing placeholders with\ncorresponding system property values if necessary.",
      "translation": "解析给定的路径，如有必要，将占位符替换为相应的系统属性值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Treat the given text as a location pattern or comma delimited location patterns\nand convert it to a Resource array.",
      "translation": "将给定的文本视为位置模式或逗号分隔的位置模式，并将其转换为资源数组。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ignoreUnresolvablePlaceholders</code> - whether to ignore unresolvable placeholders\nif no corresponding system property could be found",
      "translation": "<code>ignoreUnresolvablePlaceholders</code> - 如果找不到对应的系统属性，是否忽略无法解析的占位符",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Juergen Hoeller, Chris Beams, Yanming Zhou, Stephane Nicoll",
      "translation": "Jürgen Hoeller, Chris Beams, Yanming Zhou, Stephane Nicoll",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Treat the given value as a collection or array and convert it to a Resource array.",
      "translation": "将给定值视为集合或数组，并将其转换为 Resource 数组。",
      "count": 1
    },
